+
+On Linux, build Python 3.10+, FPC 3.2.2, GNU Make, CMake 3.20+, pkg-config, and development
 libraries for SDL2 2.26+ (or SDL2-compat), libogg, libvorbis, libjpeg, and libpng.
 
